  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Open
  s1: Claimed
  s2: Claimed #183; release in progress
  s3: Claimed #183; release + expiry in progress
  s4: Open #183; release in progress
  s5: Open #183; a builder still holds a claim
  s6: Claimed #183; two builders hold claims
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a builder claims the task
  s1 --> s2: a builder asks to release the claim
  s2 --> s3: the expiry job picks up a stale claim
  s3 --> s4: the claim is expired
  s4 --> s2: a builder claims the task
  s2 --> s5: the release is written
  s5 --> s6: a builder claims the task
